Praxis Prime is the flagship evolution of SMF Praxis (smfworks/smf-praxis),
by SMF Works. The design reuses ideas, and later may reuse MIT-licensed code,
from projects SMF Works does not own. Those projects remain the work of their
authors. Nothing in this repository implies that they endorse Praxis Prime.

